WEBVTT

00:07:58.299 --> 00:08:00.090
I reče:

00:08:00.114 --> 00:08:02.465
"Gledali smo vaš TED govor 
u mom čitalačkom klubu

00:08:03.116 --> 00:08:06.465
Onda smo pročitali vašu knjigu
i promenile svoje ime u

00:08:06.489 --> 00:08:08.466
"Havarisani komadi".

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.729
(Smeh)

00:08:09.753 --> 00:08:11.765
I reče" "Naš slogan je:

00:08:11.789 --> 00:08:14.976
"Raspadamo se, a osećaj je nestvaran."

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.829
(Smeh)

00:08:18.853 --> 00:08:22.266
Možete samo zamisliti kako mi je
na sastanku nastavničkog veća.

00:08:22.925 --> 00:08:23.925
(Uzdah)

00:08:25.433 --> 00:08:28.335
I kad sam postala Ranjiva TED,

00:08:28.359 --> 00:08:29.708
kao neka akciona figura,